1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,040
Or worse, you get, have you tried going outside more?

2
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:06,960
I have watched men, I genuinely care about, they disappear into silence, a close friend

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:11,880
going through a brutal break up, another drowning in financial pressure.

4
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:19,560
I would ask how they were doing, they would say, it's nothing, eyes said otherwise.

5
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:25,000
And I get it, because I did the same thing, for years I white knuckle life, passive aggressive

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,400
in meetings, rude to people I cared about, rude to people I cared about, waking at 3am,

7
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:35,520
running mental loops, I couldn't switch off, I told myself that I was just the cost

8
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:42,680
of ambition, it wasn't, it was a person who needed help and had no framework for asking

9
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:42,700
for it.
